<title>republic of ireland: HORSE RACING-OSCAR SCHINDLER WINS IRISH ST LEGER.</title>
<headline>HORSE RACING-OSCAR SCHINDLER WINS IRISH ST LEGER.</headline>
<dateline>THE CURRAGH, Ireland 1996-09-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Oscar Schindler, ridden by Stephen Craine, won the Irish St Leger horse racing classic on Saturday.</p>
